{"id":"en_i-turned-omega-at-the-wolf-king-s-duel","title":"I Turned Omega at the Wolf King's Duel","titleEn":"I Turned Omega at the Wolf King's Duel","description":"In the Blackstone Wolf Clan, a throne duel ends in defeat for Alpha Kane, who is transformed into an Omega and discovers a fated mate bond. Exiled from the clan, he combines his Alpha fighting skills with an Omega's heightened perception to endure the schemes of the Elder Council. Political conflict tests his bond with Drake, yet their love endures. After Kane's true identity comes to light, Drake gives up his crown to rescue him, turning his back on a hierarchy built on gender. Using Kane's strategies, the two overcome corrupt Elders and outside invaders.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-turned-omega-at-the-wolf-kings-duel/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-turned-omega-at-the-wolf-kings-duel/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Bitter Love","Fantasy","LGBTQ+","Reunion","Romance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7db60o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_i-turned-omega-at-the-wolf-king-s-duel_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7db60o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-turned-omega-at-the-wolf-king-s-duel_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7db60o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-turned-omega-at-the-wolf-king-s-duel_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7db60o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-turned-omega-at-t